OL,3,GNEWSAStation expected to see record
OL,4,Anumber of passengers
OL,5,
OL,6,FA record number of passengers are
OL,7,Fexpected to travel through Leeds
OL,8,FRailway Station over the bank holiday
OL,9,Fweekend, as a major music festival gets
OL,10,Finto full swing.
OL,12,FNorthern said more than 113,000 people
OL,13,F- a 5% increase from the year before -
OL,14,Fused the city-centre hub over the same
OL,15,Fweekend last year and it expected that
OL,16,Ffigure to be surpassed this year.
OL,18,FLeeds Festival starts later with
OL,19,FKasabian headlining, and 90,000 people
OL,20,Fare expected to attend the four-day
OL,21,Fevent.
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
